{"2280910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swords & Bones 3", "steam_appid": 2280910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Swords and Bones 3 is a game inspired by 80s and 90s action-platformer games with a modern and polished level design. Off course, all in pixel-art!<br>In the game you will take on the role of a young rogue, able to move with much more agility than the heroes of the previous two chapters.<br>A long journey awaits you: from the dungeon to the lair of the last boss; you will face a series of levels filled with traps and nasty enemies. <br>In Swords &amp; Bones, you will put your skills to the test thanks to a balanced and never unfair difficulty.<br>Each enemy you annihilate will earn you coins to spend on new spells, items and power-ups!<br>Will you be able to win the whole game and see the real ending?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new story!<br></li><li>Dodge attacks and boosts your agility!<br></li><li>Use combos to annihilate enemies!<br></li><li>Improved graphics!<br></li><li>4 new devastating spells to master!<br></li><li>Power up your hero collecting coins!<br></li><li>Over 50 action-packed levels!<br></li><li>6 fearsome bosses ready to fight!<br></li><li>Two endings to discover!<br></li><li>Pixel-art graphics in 16-bit style!<br></li><li>An epic and dark chiptune soundtrack!<br></li><li>Achievements!</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "Swords and Bones 3 is a game inspired by 80s and 90s action-platformer games with a modern and polished level design. Off course, all in pixel-art!<br>In the game you will take on the role of a young rogue, able to move with much more agility than the heroes of the previous two chapters.<br>A long journey awaits you: from the dungeon to the lair of the last boss; you will face a series of levels filled with traps and nasty enemies. <br>In Swords &amp; Bones, you will put your skills to the test thanks to a balanced and never unfair difficulty.<br>Each enemy you annihilate will earn you coins to spend on new spells, items and power-ups!<br>Will you be able to win the whole game and see the real ending?<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new story!<br></li><li>Dodge attacks and boosts your agility!<br></li><li>Use combos to annihilate enemies!<br></li><li>Improved graphics!<br></li><li>4 new devastating spells to master!<br></li><li>Power up your hero collecting coins!<br></li><li>Over 50 action-packed levels!<br></li><li>6 fearsome bosses ready to fight!<br></li><li>Two endings to discover!<br></li><li>Pixel-art graphics in 16-bit style!<br></li><li>An epic and dark chiptune soundtrack!<br></li><li>Achievements!</li></ul>", "short_description": "The Swords &amp; Bones saga reaches its third chapter! Inspired by past classics 2D action-platformer games, get ready to fight your way through more than 50 levels full of with enemies, traps and pitfalls. RPG elements enrich the gaming experience.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280910/header.jpg?t=1678125774", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1678125774", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1678125774", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> XP, Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8.1, Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 128 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB di RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["SEEP"], "publishers": ["SEEP"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "